<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Crissel tender for 25,000 T barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Crissel tender for 25,000 T barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus has accepted Crissel S.A. Greece's tender for 25,000 tonnes of barley at $140.90 per tonne, the Grain Commission said in a statement.</p>
<p>Prices are C and F. Shipment is scheduled in January 1997.</p>
</text>
